    "detailed_description": "This game is a single-player 2D action game. <br>You control RIDLE to find the keys that exist on the stage and rescue the animals from the jail!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Vertical and horizontal stage exploration</h2>RIDLE can stick to walls and move across the stage in any direction.<br><br>Explore the stage, collect items, and defeat enemy monsters to clear the stage!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Aim to clear the screen with easy operation!</h2>It can be operated with only the movement keys and three buttons.<br><br>\u30fbKeyboard and gamepad operation are supported. <br>\u30fbEach key can be changed on the configuration screen.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Aim to clear the highest rank!</h2>When the game is completed, the rank is evaluated in several categories.<br><br>Play the game over and over again to clear the game at the highest rank.",
